sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant API as CLAM API
    participant Store as SQLite

    Client->>API: POST /api/v1/decisionModel
    API->>Store: INSERT decision_model
    Store-->>API: id
    API-->>Client: 201 + DecisionModel

    Client->>API: POST /api/v1/closedLoop
    Note right of API: body.decisionModelRef.id = <dm id>
    API->>Store: INSERT closed_loop
    Store-->>API: id
    API-->>Client: 201 + ClosedLoop (state=designed)

    Client->>API: POST /api/v1/closedLoop/{id}/state
    Note right of API: targetState=validated
    API->>Store: UPDATE state
    API-->>Client: 200 + {state: validated}